{"id":4532,"date":"2023-03-02T13:44:47","date_gmt":"2023-03-02T13:44:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/crazy-albattani.77-68-55-102.plesk.page\/?page_id=4532"},"modified":"2024-10-04T10:05:42","modified_gmt":"2024-10-04T10:05:42","slug":"selection-criteria","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/selection-criteria\/","title":{"rendered":"Team Selection and Eligibility Criteria"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 1: Eligibility for Shooting for England<\/strong><br>To be eligible to shoot for England, you must:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Be affiliated with an English Region and<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Meet at least one of the following:<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be born in England<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Have a parent or grandparent born in England<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Have lived in England for at least one year before the event<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 2: Team Selection<\/strong><br>If the selection criteria can&#8217;t be followed due to time constraints, the Archery England Team Selection Panel can make necessary decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 3: Tournament Entry Requirements<\/strong><br>Applies to all archers (senior and junior):<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Must have entered the event (unless it&#8217;s a stand-alone tournament)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Must have confirmation of a place at the event<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Must not be on a waiting list for the event<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 4: Senior Archers<\/strong><br>For Home Nations Indoor &amp; Outdoor Target events:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Must not have represented GB in target archery as a senior in the last 12 months<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Other than Barebow Archers (as there is no opportunity to shoot for GB outdoors)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Scores must be from WRS events and submitted before the deadline<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Must confirm their place at the tournament if selected<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 5: Commonwealth Archery Championships of Europe (CACE)<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Archers who have represented GB as a senior in the last 12 months may submit scores<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Junior archers who represented GB as juniors in the last 12 months are eligible for senior selection but not junior selection<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Junior archers who represented GB as seniors in the last 12 months are not eligible for senior or junior selection<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 6: Junior Archers<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Must be at least 13 years old on the first day of the event<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Maximum age: 18 for Archery GB and Home Nations events, 21 for World Archery and international events<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Must enter the appropriate age round<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Junior archers who represented GB as juniors in the last 12 months are eligible for senior but not junior selection<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Junior archers who represented GB as seniors in the last 12 months are eligible for junior but not senior selection<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Archers who represented GB as juniors and seniors in the last 12 months are not eligible for either<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Scores must be submitted before the deadline<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Archery England Training Camp Selection<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 7: Training Camp Eligibility<\/strong><br>Open to all senior (adult) Archery England affiliated archers:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Must not have represented GB in target archery as a senior in the last 12 months<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Must not have regular access to Archery GB coaching facilities<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Must have submitted scores for Archery England rankings or tournaments in the last 12 months<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 8: Selection Process<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Top 3 ranked archers by category and gender who meet the criteria will get first refusal for training camps<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Top 3 scores submitted from the previous 12 months competitions<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Efforts will be made to use these criteria wherever possible<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 9: Special Invitations<\/strong><br>Archery England may invite archers to training camps if time constraints would impact participation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Section 10: Junior Archers<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Not eligible for training camps due to safeguarding guidelines<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For questions, contact Archery England via email.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Please visit the team selection process page to access the score submission forms&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Section 1: Eligibility for Shooting for EnglandTo be eligible to shoot for England, you must: Section 2: Team SelectionIf the selection criteria can&#8217;t be followed due to time constraints, the Archery England Team Selection Panel can make necessary decisions. Section 3: Tournament Entry RequirementsApplies to all archers (senior and junior): Section 4: Senior ArchersFor Home &hellip; <\/p>\n<p class=\"link-more\"><a href=\"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/selection-criteria\/\" class=\"more-link\">Read more<span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> &#8220;Team Selection and Eligibility Criteria&#8221;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":4615,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4532","page","type-page","stat